 "blurb": "Content slides in from off-screen when scrolling it into view.",
 "description": "Wraps children; animates slide-in on scroll with customizable distance, direction, scale, and opacity. Uses GSAP ScrollTrigger for scroll detection. Optionally disappears after a delay.",
 "use_when": "Reveal content on scroll, add entrance animations to sections, or create depth with staggered reveals.",
